flutter_frontend/

# Using **/ ensures it catches these folders even if they are inside 'flutter_frontend'
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/packages/
.packages

