**/.gradle/
**/android/app/debug/
**/android/app/profile/
**/android/app/release/
**/android/local.properties
**/android/**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java

# --- C++ / CMake (The stuff in your error log) ---
**/*.ninja
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/CMakeFiles/
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/*.bin
**/*.lock
**/.cxx/

